# Off-Page SEO

**Intent:** Earn credibility signals Google can't infer from on-page alone — backlinks, mentions, reviews, entity presence. Skip for on-page fixes (`on-page-seo.mdc`) or paid search (`google-ads.mdc`).

## Rule zero: destinations before outreach

Never pitch links to a weak landing page. Ship and index first:

- [ ] Pricing page live (even "free during beta")
- [ ] Privacy policy + terms
- [ ] 3+ competitor alternative pages (`/alternatives/[competitor]`)
- [ ] 3+ use-case or persona pages
- [ ] FAQ schema on key landing pages (`FAQPage` JSON-LD)

Directories and outreach pass **link equity** to these pages — build destinations before submitting anywhere.

## Channel playbook (pick 2, don't spray)

| Channel | DIY action |
|---------|------------|
| Niche directories | Product Hunt, G2, Capterra, category-specific lists — unique blurb per site |
| Reviews | Ask real customers; never buy reviews |
| Community | Reddit, forums, Quora — genuine answers, no link drops |
| Guest posts / PR | Data-led asset journalists can cite |
| Unlinked mentions | Google `"your brand" -site:yourdomain.com` → polite reclaim email |
| Partnerships | Co-marketing, integrations, roundup inclusion |

**Positioning:** vary description by audience (founders vs buyers vs devs). Never copy-paste identical blurbs across 50 directories.

## Outreach template (unlinked mention / broken link)

```
Subject: Quick fix on [Article title]

Hi [Name], I enjoyed [specific detail from their post].

I noticed [broken link / mention of Brand without link]. We have [relevant resource URL] that covers [topic] — happy if it's useful as a reference.

Either way, thanks for the great content.
[Your name]
```

## Avoid

- Paid link packs, PBNs, link farms, irrelevant directories
- Exact-match anchor over-optimization
- Disavow file unless manual penalty suspected — don't disavow normal noise

## Measure yourself (free)

- GSC → Links → top linking sites and pages
- GSC → branded query impressions over time
- GA4 → referral traffic and assisted conversions
- Judge **referring domain relevance**, not vanity DR alone

## Output format

**90-day plan** — table: Week | Action | Channel | Success signal (e.g., link live, referral session, branded search up).

## Your routine

- **Weekly:** 5 outreach emails OR 2 quality directory submissions.
- **Monthly:** GSC Links report; prune low-quality submissions; update destination pages.

## Free tools

Google Search Console, Google Alerts (`"your brand"`), manual `"brand" -site:domain` search.

